Package: EvoTrace
Type: Package
Title: Analyze and Visualize Evolutionary Trace Scores on Protein Structures
Version: 0.1.1
Author: Chen Wang
Maintainer: Chen Wang <chen.wang@bcm.edu>
Description: Tools for mapping evolutionary trace scores, variants, and residue-level
    annotations onto protein sequences and structures. Includes helpers for reading
    evolutionary trace outputs, aligning sequence and structure coordinates, computing
    structural distance and smoothness metrics, generating PyMOL coloring commands,
    and creating protein variant visualizations.
